  "description": "Production-ready HttpClient resilience ecosystem with universal response handlers,\n      HttpClient substitution patterns, retry policies, and circuit breakers. Zero configuration\n      required.",
  "id": "Reliable.HttpClient",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-09-18T11:10:14.387Z",
